# fortress-rollback-godot machine-local secrets — template.
#
# Copy to .env.local (repo root, gitignored) and fill in the keys you use.
# Every key here is OPTIONAL.
#
# On every container start, .devcontainer/sync-env.sh loads this file and
# syncs its non-empty values into /etc/environment, so login shells, VS
# Code, OpenCode, and the gh CLI all see them. Precedence:
#
#   1. .env.local                     (this file, machine-local)
#   2. .devcontainer/devcontainer.env (docker --env-file, applied at
#                                      container creation only)
#   3. `gh auth token`                (GITHUB_TOKEN fallback only)
#
# NEVER commit .env.local or paste real keys anywhere else.
#
# Format rules: one KEY=value per line; NO quotes around values; NO inline
# comments after values; no `export`. Blank lines and full-line comments
# starting with # are fine. Violations cause SILENT corruption.

# ── GitHub ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Used by the GitHub MCP server and the gh CLI. Scopes: repo, read:org.
# Paste your PAT here to override the gh CLI fallback:
GITHUB_TOKEN=

# ── OpenRouter ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# OpenCode provider; optional Claude Code routing.
# https://openrouter.ai/settings/keys
OPENROUTER_API_KEY=

# ── z.ai GLM Coding Plan ───────────────────────────────────────────
# OpenCode `zai-coding-plan` provider.
# https://z.ai/manage-apikey/apikey-list
ZAI_API_KEY=
